WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Hi there! Meet DeepsFin360, the financial services operations platform built for PNG and the Pacific.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Start by registering your institution, then bring your customer accounts on board with KYC status at a glance.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Record deposits, withdrawals, and transfers across branches, agents, and mobile, all in one place.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
When something looks off, flagged transactions land in a review queue so your team can clear them quickly.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
See your branches and agents across the coverage map, then export an audit-ready report in one click.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
DeepsFin360, banking that reaches everyone. Built for PNG and the Pacific by Deeps Systems. Everything here is demo data.
